WEBVTT

1
00:00:07.997 --> 00:00:11.259
ago, there lived a farmer and his dog named Shelly.

2
00:00:12.140 --> 00:00:14.561
The dog was very faithful to his master.

3
00:00:16.203 --> 00:00:18.985
The farmer also liked the dog very much.

4
00:00:19.705 --> 00:00:21.606
He took good care of his dog.

5
00:00:23.187 --> 00:00:26.690
One hot day, the farmer returned home from the field.

6
00:00:26.710 --> 00:00:29.592
"Whew! I am thirsty!

7
00:00:30.116 --> 00:00:33.117
I wonder where the water jar is," he said.

8
00:00:34.878 --> 00:00:37.719
He found the jar and lifted it to drink some water.

9
00:00:38.439 --> 00:00:41.020
But all of a sudden, the dog barked.

10
00:00:41.040 --> 00:00:42.401
"Woof, woof."

11
00:00:43.041 --> 00:00:45.562
The dog barked and barked some more.

12
00:00:51.485 --> 00:00:53.205
Shelly! Please be quiet!"

13
00:00:53.806 --> 00:00:54.766
the farmer said.

14
00:00:54.786 --> 00:00:56.667
"Are you thirsty too?

15
00:00:57.267 --> 00:00:59.588
I will give you some water when I am finished."

16
00:01:00.288 --> 00:01:02.650
But the dog did not stop barking.

17
00:01:03.211 --> 00:01:05.352
He even jumped up on his master.

18
00:01:05.372 --> 00:01:09.376
"Hmm," said the farmer.

19
00:01:09.396 --> 00:01:11.057
"Maybe, you are hungry.

20
00:01:11.818 --> 00:01:13.559
Let me drink some water first.

21
00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:16.102
Then I will give you something to eat."

22
00:01:16.122 --> 00:01:19.685
"Woof, woof, woof!"

23
00:01:20.205 --> 00:01:21.106
barked the dog.

24
00:01:21.867 --> 00:01:23.228
"Oh, what's the matter with you?

25
00:01:23.708 --> 00:01:25.109
You are so greedy!

26
00:01:25.810 --> 00:01:27.932
Can't you let me drink some water first?"

27
00:01:28.712 --> 00:01:31.915
The farmer was so angry that he kicked his dog!

28
00:01:35.177 --> 00:01:37.759
But the dog did not stop jumping on him.

29
00:01:37.779 --> 00:01:40.041
"You are crazy, Shelly!

30
00:01:40.301 --> 00:01:41.062
Go away!"

31
00:01:41.723 --> 00:01:42.523
said the farmer.

32
00:01:44.205 --> 00:01:45.746
The dog did not give up.

33
00:01:46.306 --> 00:01:48.848
He jumped up and bit his master's hand.

34
00:01:48.868 --> 00:01:51.691
"Ouch!" yelled the farmer.

35
00:01:52.251 --> 00:01:55.213
The jar crashed on the ground and broke into pieces.

36
00:01:55.233 --> 00:01:58.116
"Oh no!"

37
00:01:58.900 --> 00:02:03.044
The farmer was so angry that he picked up a stick to hit the dog.

38
00:02:04.285 --> 00:02:07.988
But then he noticed a dead snake among the pieces of the jar.

39
00:02:08.828 --> 00:02:10.790
He knew that the snake was poisonous.

40
00:02:10.810 --> 00:02:14.733
"Oh my!

41
00:02:15.274 --> 00:02:17.075
Then the water is poisonous too!"

42
00:02:17.756 --> 00:02:18.556
said the farmer.

43
00:02:19.317 --> 00:02:23.460
"Hmm, I guess Shelly saw the snake slip into the jar."

44
00:02:23.480 --> 00:02:24.942
"Woof, woof!"

45
00:02:25.582 --> 00:02:27.504
Shelly barked and wagged his tail.

46
00:02:28.276 --> 00:02:29.937
"Oh, my faithful dog!

47
00:02:30.257 --> 00:02:31.618
You saved my life!"

48
00:02:34.740 --> 00:02:38.162
The farmer felt sorry and regretted hurting his dog.

49
00:02:38.802 --> 00:02:40.123
He gave Shelly a pat.

50
00:02:40.143 --> 00:02:41.944
"You were right, Shelly.

51
00:02:42.404 --> 00:02:43.845
Next time, I will listen!

52
00:02:44.425 --> 00:02:48.808
And I promise not to hit you ever again," he said.
